Also a 'y' can be required if the word is a tosmabru. (I'm not sure what 
"tosmabru" is supposed to mean. "tos" isn't the rafsi of anything.) Some 
examples are jesyratcu (porcupine), jesymabru (hedgehog or spiny anteater, 
va'i ernace fa'u zalgosu), and bakyrectu (beef). If you drop the 'y' you get 
something from which the first two letters fall off.

